<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-WPL upgraded by Everen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-WPL upgraded by Everen.</headline>
<text>
<p>--WPL Holdings Inc was upgraded by Everen Securities analyst Dan Rudakas to market performer-outperform from market performer-market performer.</p>
<p>--Shares in the power utility closed Thursday off 1/8 to 27.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
